    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.4</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:32:41 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Show power use in the menu bar as a level meter with the wattage beside it.</p><p>Settings has a fresh glass look, keeps one size for every tab, and picks the meter colour with a slider.</p><p>The menu bar panel's bars now match your meter colour.</p>]]></description>
