      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>First public release of Usage Finder.</p><p>Live CPU, memory, swap and power meters in the menu bar, with history charts in the main window.</p><p>Updates now install automatically from Settings → General.</p>]]></description>
